Want to stop selling a license for a beat? Learn how to disable specific licenses on Beat22 in just a few easy steps.

1.  **Log into your Beat22 seller account**
2.  ****Click on Browse at the top****
    
    ![Click on Browse at the top](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-001325.png)
    
3.  ****Click on “My Beats”****
    
    ![Click on “My Beats”](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-212015.png)
    
4.  ****Click on Edit option \[circled\]****
    
    ![Click on Edit option circled](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-003446.png)
    
5.  **Scroll to the License Section**
6.  **Uncheck the License You Want to Disable (Non-Exclusive and Exclusive)**
7.  **Click “Submit”**
